{"id": 1, "name": "First person"}, {"id": 2, "name": "Third person"}], "release_dates": [{"id": 364727, "date": 1381363200, "platform": 46, "y": 2013, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 462668, "date": 1489449600, "platform": 48, "y": 2017, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 199594, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/z7su807r2sdzsfepnbsm.jpg"}, {"id": 199595, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/zhdvem1wptrojni8ewip.jpg"}, {"id": 199592, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/teq0cyrzxhak3q6phrtp.jpg"}, {"id": 199590, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/lgvoic009q54uudmbdcw.jpg"}, {"id": 199591, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/m4dkfdh4gyntmoiwqwdl.jpg"}, {"id": 199593, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/mcvct6oytgv5kcralfj3.jpg"}], "slug": "danganronpa-1-2-reload", "summary": "Get two of the best murder-mystery adventures in one! Whether trapped in school in Danganronpa: Trigger Happy Havoc, or stranded on an island in Danganronpa 2: Goodbye Despair, there's bound to be thrills, chills, and kills! In Danganronpa: Trigger Happy Havoc, enter Hope's Peak Academy, a prestigious high school reserved for the nation's \"ultimate\" students. Things get a bit twisted when the academy's students find themselves trapped inside with Monokuma, a maniacal bear who has taken them all prisoner to play his game of despair. Continue the adventure in Danganronpa 2: Goodbye Despair with a brand new cast of Ultimates. Mysteriously trapped on Jabberwock Island in their own life-or-death game, having fun in the sun with this twisted teddy requires more than a bit of wit to survive.\n\nTwo Mystery Adventures in One! - For the first time ever, experience two of the greatest visual novel adventures in one package for the PlayStation 4!\nMonokuma's His Name, Murder's His Game - Face the twisted challenges of this maniacal bear and piece together the clues to uncover the truth fueling his deadly games.\nHope and Despair - Meet memorable characters, solve mysterious murders, and complete games of logic all culminating in life-or-death decisions in the ultimate battle of hope and despair!", "themes": [{"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/danganronpa-1-2-reload", "videos": [{"id": 35396, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "6DGuCuHurUk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6DGuCuHurUk", "title": "Danganronpa 1\u20222 Reload - Announcement Trailer | PS4", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6DGuCuHurUk/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}